      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To create a more culturally resonant experience, consider analyzing the design preferences and associations of users from diverse backgrounds. For instance, studies have shown that users from Asia tend to prefer minimalism and subtlety in design, while users from Europe and Latin America may appreciate bold colors and patterns. Additionally, emotional intelligence and collectivist cultures like Arab and Asian communities may prioritize harmony and cooperation in UI interactions. Analyze psychological studies on cultural intelligence and design empathy to guide your decisions on visual design, interactivity, and tone.",
